  unitName: Holy Ice Selena
  unitId: 20015
  unitNumber: 339
  description: A swordswoman from the ruined Sama Kingdom. She is the savior of her
    kingdom, and one of the Six Heroes. The Savat people she led all lost their lives
    in the great war. As the last one standing, she tried to end her life, but a
    voice from her sword Lexida halted her. It was the voices of her fallen countrymen.
    With her allies' souls in her sword, she fought with more strength and beauty
    than ever before.
  summonDesc: You who have summoned me.<br>I'm not easy to command.<br>Don't say
    I didn't warn you!
  fusionDesc: Don't worry, I'm here.<br>Fight with all you have<br>until the sword
    in your heart breaks.
  evoDesc: Spirits residing within my Lexida!<br>Once again, lend me your power!<br>The
    power to destroy the gods!
  element: 2
  rarity: 5
